* Differential crossbar: output = positive current - negative current
* One row input per voltage source; two grounded sense sources per output
* Input voltages
* Conductance paths (P = positive, N = negative)
* Output current sensors
.tran 0 1u
* Use AVG sensor currents to reconstruct signed vector results
.meas TRAN IP1 AVG I(VSENSE1P) FROM=0 TO=1u
.meas TRAN IN1 AVG I(VSENSE1N) FROM=0 TO=1u
.meas TRAN IP2 AVG I(VSENSE2P) FROM=0 TO=1u
.meas TRAN IN2 AVG I(VSENSE2N) FROM=0 TO=1u
.meas TRAN IP3 AVG I(VSENSE3P) FROM=0 TO=1u
.meas TRAN IN3 AVG I(VSENSE3N) FROM=0 TO=1u
.backanno
